00:58:30.900  -->  00:58:33.240
Apakah kamu ingin mendengar kakekmu bernyanyi?

00:58:33.450  -->  00:58:34.240
Ya!

00:59:11.990  -->  00:59:13.820
Ayah menyayangi kita.

00:59:15.660  -->  00:59:17.580
Ibu mencintai kita.

00:59:19.790  -->  00:59:21.660
